# Vivaldi, L'autunno / Autumn, Op. 8 No. 3, RV 293, first movement (Allegro, F major).
# The notes are the Mutopia Project's (examples/scores/rv293-autumn.mid,
# CC BY-SA 3.0, see examples/scores/LICENSE.txt), imported as they are.
# Autumn's peasant dance: an ARP 2600 lead fiddles the solo, CS-15 and
# ARP strings the violins, an SH-101 viola and an SH-101 bass for the cello.
tempo 120
swing 50

track solo synth Arp2600 Lead
track violin1 synth Cs15 Cs15Strings
track violin2 synth Arp2600 SolinaStrings
track viola synth Sh101 Sh101Strings
track cello synth Sh101 Sh101Bass
strip solo: Level 0.59, Pan 0.0, Send2 0.25
strip violin1: Level 0.38, Pan -0.45, Send2 0.35
strip violin2: Level 0.82, Pan 0.45, Send2 0.35
strip viola: Level 0.47, Pan 0.2, Send2 0.35
strip cello: Level 0.8, Pan -0.2, Send2 0.35
master: MasterGain 1, P2Type Reverb, P2Return 0.35

